  "schema_version": "1.6.2",
  "id": "BIT-tomcat-2026-118436",
  "summary": "Apache Tomcat: CGIServlet drops chunked POST body and can hang worker thread",
  "details": "Allocation of resources without limits or throttling vulnerability in Apache Tomcat in the CGI Servlet when handling POST bodies can result in a DoS for some inputs.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat: from 11.0.0 through 11.0.27, from 10.1.0 through 10.1.61, from 9.0.0 through 9.0.123.\n\n\n\nThe following versions were EOL at the time the CVE was created but are known to be affected: from 8.5.0 through 8.5.100, from 7.0.0 through 7.0.109. Other unsupported versions may also be affected.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 11.0.29, 10.1.62 or 9.0.124, which fix the issue.\nNote: Tomcat 11.0.28 was not released",
